# 真实会话库只读抽查（sqlite3 -readonly，PRAGMA query_only=1；库：~/.peri/threads/threads.db）

## 命令
sqlite3 -readonly -cmd ".timeout 8000" ~/.peri/threads/threads.db "PRAGMA query_only=1; SELECT id, message_count, ... FROM threads ORDER BY message_count DESC LIMIT 8;"

